                                "sense_id": "26fa034b-4ee0-3fa5-9d4f-5d1237f40efc",
                                "text": "The big difference between the average biblical scholar and a semiotician is, that the latter is not a consumer of texts, but tries to become, together with the text, a co-producer of meaning."
                            }
